  "id": 382,
  "description": "**Welcome to Tartarus**\n\nWe welcome all players of all playstyles, skillers  included but if you are below 25CB you will not be able to participate in our raids so please keep that in mind\n\n**Raid Schedule; Subject to change per member needs** \n\nCurrently we set Level 60/70 Raids to start at 6AM &amp; 10PM EST Saturday-Tuesday depending on leadership availability &amp; Marks. Raids are set a couple hours in advance for everyone to have the opportunity to participate if the time isn&#039;t ideal, Other Raids (Lvl 25/40) are scheduled based on member interest/request, usually 6:30PM EST.\n \nWe do not schedule Raids below level 25. Please keep an eye out for Raid Schedule notifications to avoid missing out\n\n*****\n\nAbout Us: \n\nTartarus is a small but stable Guild dedicated to offering players who can&#039;t play hyper actively but still enjoy community &amp; teamwork a home, If you find yourself removed from other guilds for not being active enough we welcome you here, We are lead by Graveyard shift blue collar folks who love gaming but understand IRL comes first, We remove only if space is needed &amp; there has been no activity for 7D+ without a heads up. \n\nEveryone deserves a place to play with others, So if this sounds like a good fit for you, then welcome home, Friend",
